      ],
      "SPECIAL ABILITIES": [
        "Darting Claw (ex) Evolved for snatching fast prey, a megalocrab is exceptionally quick with its claws. When making a full attack, if a megalocrab misses with both of its claw attacks, it can make an additional claw attack at a -2 penalty against any creature within its reach.",
