        "Powerful Claws (ex) A megalocrab's claw attacks deal damage equal to 1-1/2 times its Strength modifier. In addition, a megalocrab ignores up to 5 points of hardness when damaging objects.",
        "Water Dependency (ex) Crabs can survive out of the water for 1 hour per point of Constitution. Beyond this limit, a crab runs the risk of suffocation, as if it were drowning."
